==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Rebel Clash|Seismitoad|46}} from the {{TCG|Rebel Clash}} expansion; both cards have the Split Spiral Punch attack.
*'''Split Spiral Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX FireRed & LeafGreen|Poliwrath|11}} from the {{TCG|EX FireRed & LeafGreen}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

